{"unit":4,"no":14,"title":"Flats from the internet","blurb":"Unit 4","VOCAB":[["studio flat","","квартира-студия","студия-пәтер",""],["rent","","аренда (плата)","жалдау ақысы",""],["floor","","этаж","қабат",""],["building","","здание","ғимарат",""],["cupboard","","шкаф","шкаф",""],["sofa","","диван","диван",""],["armchair","","кресло","кресло",""],["shelf","","полка","сөре",""],["fridge","","холодильник","тоңазытқыш",""],["carpet","","ковёр","кілем",""],["curtains","","шторы","перде",""],["flatmate","","сосед по квартире","пәтерлес",""],["neighbour","","сосед","көрші",""],["view","","вид (из окна)","көрініс",""],["cosy","","уютный","жайлы",""],["bright","","светлый","жарық",""]],"SLIDES":[["🏢","I live in a flat."]],"PICWORDS":["studio flat","rent","floor","building","cupboard","sofa","armchair","shelf","fridge","carpet","curtains","flatmate","neighbour","view","cosy","bright"],"DEFS":[],"CTX":{},"COLLOC":{},"IMG":{},"NOTES":{},"TIMING":{},"tracks":{"4_8":"A1_L14_4_8.mp3","4_5":"A1_L14_4_5.mp3","4_6":"A1_L14_4_6.mp3"},"SEGS":{"4_8":[3.14,null],"4_5":[3.39,null],"4_6":[3.34,null]},"html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Intro\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 1 &middot; Intro</div>\n      <h2>Flats from the internet</h2>\n      <p>Describe your home and say where things are — with a, an and the in the right places.</p>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"self\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How to study</b> — about 25 minutes, top to bottom.</div><div>Headphones on. This lesson has real audio — tap ▶ to listen.</div><div>After each <b>Check answers</b>, read the note — that is your teacher.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How this lesson works</b> — you work with a partner. Say your answers out loud.</div><div>This lesson has real audio — tap ▶ to listen together.</div><div>Check your answers after each task.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How this lesson works</b> — you work with your teacher. Say your answers out loud.</div><div>This lesson has real audio — tap ▶ to listen together.</div><div>Check your answers after each task.</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Warm-up\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 2 &middot; Warm-up</div>\n      <h2>Warm-up</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">The photo online vs the real flat…</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Tap everything that happened to you or your friends.</p>\n      <div class=\"grid3\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><div class=\"card\"><b>📸</b> &nbsp;the photo was 10 years old</div><div class=\"card\"><b>📏</b> &nbsp;the room was TINY</div><div class=\"card\"><b>🚗</b> &nbsp;the “quiet street” was a motorway</div><div class=\"card\"><b>✨</b> &nbsp;it was actually great!</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Words\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 3 &middot; Words</div>\n      <h2>Words</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"vbar\">\n        <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin:0\">Read the words. Click a card to see an example.</div>\n        <label class=\"switch\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"trToggle\"><span class=\"track\"></span><span>Show translation</span></label>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"words\" id=\"words\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">These are your home words for this lesson.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Tap 🔊 to listen. Turn on translations only if you need them.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Recall\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 4 &middot; Recall</div>\n      <h2>Recall</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"self\">What is it? Choose the word.</div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l14s3SSt1\" data-only=\"self\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">You sit on it with three friends.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">a shelf</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">a sofa</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">an shelf</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">It keeps your food cold.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">a carpet</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">an fridge</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">a fridge</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Books stand on it.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">a curtain</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">a shelf</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">an curtain</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">It's soft and it's on the floor.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">a cupboard</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">an cupboard</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">a carpet</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">They're on the window.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">armchairs</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">curtainss</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">curtains</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">You share the flat with this person.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">a neighbour</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">a flatmate</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">an neighbour</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\" data-only=\"self\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>sofa · fridge · shelf · carpet · curtains · flatmate (a neighbour lives NEXT DOOR).</p></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"group\">Match each thing to its picture.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"group\">Tap a word, then tap its picture.</p>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"group\"><b>Word</b> &rarr; <b>Picture</b></p>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l14s3GRt3\" data-only=\"group\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\"><b>sofa</b> <select data-answer=\"🛋️\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"🛋️\">🛋️</option><option value=\"🧊\">🧊</option><option value=\"📚\">📚</option><option value=\"🟥\">🟥</option><option value=\"🪟\">🪟</option><option value=\"💺\">💺</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\"><b>fridge</b> <select data-answer=\"🧊\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"🛋️\">🛋️</option><option value=\"🧊\">🧊</option><option value=\"📚\">📚</option><option value=\"🟥\">🟥</option><option value=\"🪟\">🪟</option><option value=\"💺\">💺</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\"><b>shelf</b> <select data-answer=\"📚\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"🛋️\">🛋️</option><option value=\"🧊\">🧊</option><option value=\"📚\">📚</option><option value=\"🟥\">🟥</option><option value=\"🪟\">🪟</option><option value=\"💺\">💺</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\"><b>carpet</b> <select data-answer=\"🟥\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"🛋️\">🛋️</option><option value=\"🧊\">🧊</option><option value=\"📚\">📚</option><option value=\"🟥\">🟥</option><option value=\"🪟\">🪟</option><option value=\"💺\">💺</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\"><b>curtains</b> <select data-answer=\"🪟\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"🛋️\">🛋️</option><option value=\"🧊\">🧊</option><option value=\"📚\">📚</option><option value=\"🟥\">🟥</option><option value=\"🪟\">🪟</option><option value=\"💺\">💺</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\"><b>armchair</b> <select data-answer=\"💺\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"🛋️\">🛋️</option><option value=\"🧊\">🧊</option><option value=\"📚\">📚</option><option value=\"🟥\">🟥</option><option value=\"🪟\">🪟</option><option value=\"💺\">💺</option></select></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"solo\">Match each thing to its picture.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"solo\">Tap a word, then tap its picture.</p>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"solo\"><b>Word</b> &rarr; <b>Picture</b></p>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l14s3OOt5\" data-only=\"solo\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\"><b>sofa</b> <select data-answer=\"🛋️\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"🛋️\">🛋️</option><option value=\"🧊\">🧊</option><option value=\"📚\">📚</option><option value=\"🟥\">🟥</option><option value=\"🪟\">🪟</option><option value=\"💺\">💺</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\"><b>fridge</b> <select data-answer=\"🧊\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"🛋️\">🛋️</option><option value=\"🧊\">🧊</option><option value=\"📚\">📚</option><option value=\"🟥\">🟥</option><option value=\"🪟\">🪟</option><option value=\"💺\">💺</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\"><b>shelf</b> <select data-answer=\"📚\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"🛋️\">🛋️</option><option value=\"🧊\">🧊</option><option value=\"📚\">📚</option><option value=\"🟥\">🟥</option><option value=\"🪟\">🪟</option><option value=\"💺\">💺</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\"><b>carpet</b> <select data-answer=\"🟥\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"🛋️\">🛋️</option><option value=\"🧊\">🧊</option><option value=\"📚\">📚</option><option value=\"🟥\">🟥</option><option value=\"🪟\">🪟</option><option value=\"💺\">💺</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\"><b>curtains</b> <select data-answer=\"🪟\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"🛋️\">🛋️</option><option value=\"🧊\">🧊</option><option value=\"📚\">📚</option><option value=\"🟥\">🟥</option><option value=\"🪟\">🪟</option><option value=\"💺\">💺</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\"><b>armchair</b> <select data-answer=\"💺\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"🛋️\">🛋️</option><option value=\"🧊\">🧊</option><option value=\"📚\">📚</option><option value=\"🟥\">🟥</option><option value=\"🪟\">🪟</option><option value=\"💺\">💺</option></select></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Grammar\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 5 &middot; Grammar</div>\n      <h2>Grammar</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">a, an, the — or nothing?</div>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('4_8',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 4.8 — three sentences with articles</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">1 I live in a flat. 2 My flat is on the 5th floor. 3 There's a supermarket opposite my house.</div></details>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div>“I live in <b>a</b> flat.”</div><div>“<b>My</b> flat is on <b>the</b> 5th floor.”</div><div>“There's <b>a</b> supermarket opposite my house.”</div><div>“<b>—</b> Cafés and <b>—</b> shops are all around.”</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"blab\">Notice</div><p><span class=\"q\">Notice:</span> “I live in <b>a</b> flat. <b>The</b> flat is small.” — why <b>a</b> first, and <b>the</b> second?</p></div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:18px;overflow-x:auto\"><table class=\"gtable\"><tbody><tr><th>Article</th><th>When</th><th>Example</th></tr><tr><td class=\"pos\">a / an</td><td>first time · one of many</td><td>I live in <b>a</b> flat. · There's <b>an</b> armchair.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"pos\">the</td><td>we both know which one</td><td><b>The</b> flat is on <b>the</b> 5th floor. · <b>the</b> East River</td></tr><tr><td class=\"pos\">— (no article)</td><td>plurals in general · cities · meals</td><td>Cafés and shops are all around. · in Astana · at breakfast</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div>First time you say it → <b>a / an</b>: I live in a flat.</div><div>Now we both know which one → <b>the</b>: The flat is small. Also: the 5th floor, the centre, the East River.</div><div>No article: plurals in general (cafés, shops), cities (in Astana), meals (at breakfast).</div><div><b>an</b> before a vowel sound: an armchair, an old building.</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Practice\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 6 &middot; Practice</div>\n      <h2>Practice</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Part 1 — a, an, the — or nothing (—)?</div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l14s5t1\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">I live in ___ flat with two flatmates.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">an</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">the</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">a</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">___ flat is small, but it's bright.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">A</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">The</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">—</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">There's ___ armchair in front of the window.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">a</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">an</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">the</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">From my window I can see ___ East River.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">the</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">a</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">—</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">We live in ___ Astana.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">—</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">the</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">a</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">I have ___ breakfast at eight.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">a</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">—</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">the</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>first time → <b>a/an</b> · we know which → <b>the</b> · cities and meals → no article.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l14s5t2\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “The my flat is small.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">My flat is small.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">The flat my is small.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">The flat my are small.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “There's the supermarket opposite my house.” (first time you say it)\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">There's supermarket opposite my house.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">There's a supermarket opposite my house.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">There've a supermarket opposite my house.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “I live in the Almaty.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">I live in a Almaty.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">I live in Almaty.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">I live in an Almaty.</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>my (no the) · first mention → <b>a</b> · cities take no article.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l14s5t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">My bed is on a shelf ___ the kitchen.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">below</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">opposite</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">above</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">The building is ___ a 24-hour garage.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">opposite</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">above</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">below</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">There ___ a lift in the building.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">aren't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">isn't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">don't</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">The bus stop is ___ to the door.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">opposite</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">next</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">above</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>above the kitchen · opposite the garage · there <b>isn't</b> a lift · next to the door.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Read\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 7 &middot; Read</div>\n      <h2>Read</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">The flat in the photo — and the flat in real life.</div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l14s6t1\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">What is the big difference between the ad and the reality?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">The flat is much smaller than the photo shows.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">The rent is higher.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">There is no view.</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>The photo was beautiful — the flat is small. Very small.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l14s6t2\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">The ad says the flat is in the city centre.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">True</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">False</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">The flat has three rooms.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">False</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">True</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">The bed is on a shelf above the kitchen.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">True</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">False</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">The street is quiet at night.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">True</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">False</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">She wants to move.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">False</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">True</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>One room only · the garage makes the street <b>noisy</b> · but she loves it — “I'm not moving!”</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l14s6t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">“FOR RENT: ___ bright studio flat” — why a?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">We know which flat.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">rent</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">First time we hear about it.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">“___ flat is… small.” (text 2)\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">A</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">rent</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">The</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Find the word that means “the money you pay every month for a flat”.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">rent</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">view</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">floor</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>first mention → <b>a</b> · now we know which → <b>the</b> · <b>rent</b>.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"blab\">Notice</div><p><span class=\"q\">Before you read:</span> $800 a month in New York. Good price or bad price? Guess!</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Listen\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 8 &middot; Listen</div>\n      <h2>Listen</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"self\">Where exactly is the flat — and what's inside?</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"self\">Listen once. Then choose the correct answers.</p>\n      <div class=\"player\" data-only=\"self\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('4_5',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 4.5 — the studio flat, in detail</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\" data-only=\"self\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">The flat's on the 4th floor of a building between Delancey Street and Grand Street. The building is opposite a 24-hour garage and next to an Indian restaurant, so there are always lots of cars and people in the street. The cars are quite noisy. It's a studio flat with only one room. My bed is on a shelf above the kitchen. The toilet and shower are under the shelf. In the kitchen there's a sink, a fridge and a cooker, but there isn't a dishwasher or a washing machine — I go to the launderette on Grand Street to wash clothes. In front of the window, there's a red carpet on the floor and there's an armchair and table with a television on it. From the window, I can see the East River. It's behind the building.</div></details>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l14s7SSt3\" data-only=\"self\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">Which floor is the flat on?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">The 4th</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">The 5th</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">The 1st</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">What is the building opposite?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">A theatre</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">A 24-hour garage</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">A park</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">What ISN'T in the kitchen?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">A fridge</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">A cooker</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">A washing machine</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">What is in front of the window?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">A sofa and a TV</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">A bed</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">A red carpet and an armchair</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\" data-only=\"self\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>4th floor · opposite a garage · no dishwasher or washing machine (→ the launderette) · a red carpet and an armchair.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"group\">So why does she love this tiny flat?</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"group\">Listen once. Then choose True or False.</p>\n      <div class=\"player\" data-only=\"group\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('4_6',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 4.6 — why she loves the flat</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\" data-only=\"group\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">It's very difficult to find a flat in New York. I'm very lucky. I like my flat because it's in the centre of the city. There are shops and restaurants all around me. The Lower East Side isn't the best district in the city, but my flat is near a theatre and it's also near the East River and a small park. One of the things I don't like about my flat is that there isn't a lift. Also, unfortunately, I'm not near the underground station, but there's a bus stop opposite the door of my building.</div></details>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l14s7GRt7\" data-only=\"group\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">She likes the flat because it's in the centre.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">True</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">False</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">There's a lift in the building.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">True</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">False</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">The underground station is near.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">False</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">True</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">There's a bus stop opposite the door.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">True</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">False</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>The centre — yes. A lift — no. The underground — not near. But the bus stop is <b>opposite the door</b>.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"solo\">So why does she love this tiny flat?</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"solo\">Listen once. Then choose True or False.</p>\n      <div class=\"player\" data-only=\"solo\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('4_6',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 4.6 — why she loves the flat</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\" data-only=\"solo\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">It's very difficult to find a flat in New York. I'm very lucky. I like my flat because it's in the centre of the city. There are shops and restaurants all around me. The Lower East Side isn't the best district in the city, but my flat is near a theatre and it's also near the East River and a small park. One of the things I don't like about my flat is that there isn't a lift. Also, unfortunately, I'm not near the underground station, but there's a bus stop opposite the door of my building.</div></details>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l14s7OOt11\" data-only=\"solo\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">She likes the flat because it's in the centre.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">True</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">False</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">There's a lift in the building.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">False</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">True</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">The underground station is near.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">False</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">True</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">There's a bus stop opposite the door.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">True</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">False</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>The centre — yes. A lift — no. The underground — not near. But the bus stop is <b>opposite the door</b>.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Write\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 9 &middot; Write</div>\n      <h2>Write</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"self\">Write an internet ad for your home — then one honest sentence.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"self\">5–6 sentences with a / an / the.</p>\n      <div class=\"bubble cy\" style=\"margin-top:20px\" data-only=\"self\"><div class=\"blab\">Useful language</div><ul><li>FOR RENT: a…</li><li>The flat is on the … floor</li><li>There's a… / There are some…</li><li>a lovely view of…</li><li>cosy · bright · quiet</li><li>And the truth? …</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"group\">Describe your real home. Your partner draws the plan.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"group\">Then check the drawing together — and swap.</p>\n      <div class=\"bubble cy\" style=\"margin-top:20px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">Useful language</div><ul><li>There's a… next to the…</li><li>The … is opposite the…</li><li>above · below · in front of</li><li>on the … floor</li><li>a view of…</li><li>It's cosy / bright.</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"solo\">Describe your real home. Your teacher draws the plan.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"solo\">Then check the drawing together — and swap.</p>\n      <div class=\"bubble cy\" style=\"margin-top:20px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">Useful language</div><ul><li>There's a… next to the…</li><li>The … is opposite the…</li><li>above · below · in front of</li><li>on the … floor</li><li>a view of…</li><li>It's cosy / bright.</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>Step 1</b> — describe one room: “There's a sofa next to the window. The fridge is opposite the door. There's a carpet on the floor…”</div><div><b>Step 2</b> — your partner draws a simple plan from your words. Check it: is the sofa in the right place?</div><div><b>Step 3</b> — swap roles.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>Step 1</b> — describe one room: “There's a sofa next to the window. The fridge is opposite the door. There's a carpet on the floor…”</div><div><b>Step 2</b> — your teacher draws a simple plan from your words. Check it: is the sofa in the right place?</div><div><b>Step 3</b> — swap roles.</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Type it\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 10 &middot; Type it</div>\n      <h2>Type it</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Now produce it — type, don’t tap.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Spelling counts. Type the answers, then check.</p>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l14s9t1\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">I live in ___ flat.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"a\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">The flat has ___ big window.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"a\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">___ kitchen is next to the bedroom. (we know which one)<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"The\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>First time \\u2192 a/an \\u00b7 we both know which \\u2192 the \\u00b7 an + vowel sound.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l14s9t2\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">I live in flat.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"I live in a flat.\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">The flat has the small kitchen.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"The flat has a small kitchen.\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Sofa is next to window.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"The sofa is next to the window.\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>First time \\u2192 a/an \\u00b7 we both know which \\u2192 the \\u00b7 an + vowel sound.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l14s9t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">Add articles: I have cat. Cat is black.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"I have a cat. The cat is black.\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">Add the article: She lives in old house.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"She lives in an old house.\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Add the article: This is best view!<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"This is the best view!\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>First time \\u2192 a/an \\u00b7 we both know which \\u2192 the \\u00b7 an + vowel sound.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Done\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 11 &middot; Done</div>\n      <h2>Done</h2>\n    </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n"}